5. ATLAS (bench/)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The benchmark programs in bench/ use timing programs, test drivers and
headers of ATLAS (Automatically Tuned Linear Algebra Software, version
3.10.1, http://math-atlas.sourceforge.net/), Copyright R. Clint Whaley,
Antoine P. Petitet, Jeff Horner and other contributors:

- unmodified copies of ATLAS 3.10.1 files (with their copyright notices);
- bench/l1blastst.c and bench/lutst.c: ATLAS 3.10.1 files with small
  modifications by ulmBLAS (a help text, a printf format, a return type);
- bench/atlas_type.h, bench/atlas_dsysinfo.h, bench/dXover.h,
  bench/dmm.h: headers generated by an ATLAS installation.

The build files in bench/ (Makefile, Makefile.*, cases/, config/,
gnuplot.in) belong to ulmBLAS.  The ATLAS license, as stated in the
headers of the ATLAS files (here from bench/ATL_cputime.c):

            Automatically Tuned Linear Algebra Software v3.10.1
                   (C) Copyright 1997 R. Clint Whaley

Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions
are met:
