7. BLIS-derived GEMM micro kernels (ulmblas/level3/ukernel/blis/)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The files in ulmblas/level3/ukernel/blis/kernel/ and asm/ are generated by
mk/vendor_blis_kernels.py from unmodified files of BLIS 2.0
(https://github.com/flame/blis, tag 2.0) and AOCL-BLAS 5.0 and 5.1
(https://github.com/amd/blis, tags 5.0, 5.1); each file names its source,
revision and SHA-256 and lists the mechanical changes.  They are
distributed under the license of their source files, which carry the
following copyright notices:

