8. OpenBLAS-derived GEMM micro kernels (ulmblas/level3/ukernel/openblas/)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The files in ulmblas/level3/ukernel/openblas/kernel/ (except
haswell_4x8.h) and ulmblas/level3/ukernel/openblas/asm/ (except compat.h)
are generated by mk/vendor_openblas_kernels.py from files of OpenBLAS
0.3.34 (https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS, tag v0.3.34); each file
names its source, revision and SHA-256 and lists its changes.  They are
distributed under the license of OpenBLAS.  asm/haswell_4x8.S keeps the
license comment of its source file (Copyright (c) 2015, The OpenBLAS
Project, the same terms); the license of the OpenBLAS repository:

Copyright (c) 2011-2014, The OpenBLAS Project
All rights reserved.

